    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Delivery Bro is out here trying to deliver your packages, and you never think about how hard it is for him to do it. You probably want to punch him in the face. Shame on you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the Delivery Bro and experience the daily struggle for yourself as you carry the weight of the world on your shoulders.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You think it's easy to deliver packages?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have to do is carry them on your back, <i>but the rest of the world doesn't care about the <strong>struggle</strong> you go through!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652230/extras/31a99a150b250780b82bece6362d8846.poster.avif?t=1750682397\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652230/extras/31a99a150b250780b82bece6362d8846.webm?t=1750682397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652230/extras/31a99a150b250780b82bece6362d8846.mp4?t=1750682397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different obstacles make a successful day's work that much sweeter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652230/extras/9cd4201c4cc5a1483190cc71707456dc.poster.avif?t=1750682397\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652230/extras/9cd4201c4cc5a1483190cc71707456dc.webm?t=1750682397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652230/extras/9cd4201c4cc5a1483190cc71707456dc.mp4?t=1750682397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch Out!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is why your delivery people hate you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652230/extras/f07234346f00220295a3810ade562562.poster.avif?t=1750682397\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652230/extras/f07234346f00220295a3810ade562562.webm?t=1750682397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652230/extras/f07234346f00220295a3810ade562562.mp4?t=1750682397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Medals</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platinum: Reach the end in less than 25 minutes with checkpoints <i>OFF</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold: Reach the end in less than 45 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silver: Reach the end in Less than 60 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bronze: Reach the end</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rewarding day's work</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional checkpoints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rage</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Delivery Bro is out here trying to deliver your packages, and you never think about how hard it is for him to do it. You probably want to punch him in the face. Shame on you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the Delivery Bro and experience the daily struggle for yourself as you carry the weight of the world on your shoulders.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You think it's easy to deliver packages?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have to do is carry them on your back, <i>but the rest of the world doesn't care about the <strong>struggle</strong> you go through!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652230/extras/31a99a150b250780b82bece6362d8846.poster.avif?t=1750682397\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652230/extras/31a99a150b250780b82bece6362d8846.webm?t=1750682397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652230/extras/31a99a150b250780b82bece6362d8846.mp4?t=1750682397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different obstacles make a successful day's work that much sweeter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652230/extras/9cd4201c4cc5a1483190cc71707456dc.poster.avif?t=1750682397\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652230/extras/9cd4201c4cc5a1483190cc71707456dc.webm?t=1750682397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652230/extras/9cd4201c4cc5a1483190cc71707456dc.mp4?t=1750682397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch Out!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is why your delivery people hate you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652230/extras/f07234346f00220295a3810ade562562.poster.avif?t=1750682397\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652230/extras/f07234346f00220295a3810ade562562.webm?t=1750682397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652230/extras/f07234346f00220295a3810ade562562.mp4?t=1750682397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Medals</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platinum: Reach the end in less than 25 minutes with checkpoints <i>OFF</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold: Reach the end in less than 45 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silver: Reach the end in Less than 60 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bronze: Reach the end</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rewarding day's work</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional checkpoints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rage</p></li></ul>",
